  2000	                        probe_present, eps, external, external_why, exp25_base_dir, partial):
  2001	    """§5's fail-closed list -- it refuses even with ``partial``; cells not run yet, a B-F probe not run yet and an
  2002	    E2 that did not PASS are the only gaps, labelled under ``partial``."""
